  "id": 784,
  "description": "## 👻 Souls Hub 👻  \n\nIn a world where the boundaries between life and death are fragile, where souls wander in an endless, aimless journey, a place of hope emerges - the Souls Hub.  \nHere, they are reborn, forged into warriors, anglers and miners, fighting and working not for destruction, but for purpose. In the quiet darkness, they reclaim their destiny and protect the realms from the same fate of aimlessness. \n\n‎ \n \n\n\n### 🔹 Info\nThe **Souls Hub** is a laid-back guild where the focus is on steady progress, not intense grind. We believe in a relaxed, yet consistent approach to gaming. No pressure, just regular and meaningful participation is required.  \n\n‎ \n \n\n\n### 🔹 Requirements\n- Just consistency and a desire to have fun! If you&#039;re active, you&#039;re in! 🙌  \n- To join the guild, **you must first apply on our Discord server** ⚠️\n  - We do not accept in-game players unless a request has first been submitted on the server!\n- No alt accounts (max 1 character per user)  \n\n‎ \n \n\n\n\n### 🔹 Benefits\n- Cool and useful Discord bots (see below) 🤖\n- Rewards based on each member&#039;s activity 🏆\n- Giveaways 🎁\n- Forging and alchemy services for all guild members ⚒️\n\n\n‎ \n \n\n\n\n### 🔹 Raids  \nEveryday schedule:\n- **Combat level 60**: **17:00 UTC+0** (5.00PM UTC)  \n- **Combat level 80**: **18:00 UTC+0** (6.00PM UTC)‎ \n\n‎ \n \n\n\n### 🔹 Discord\nJoin our **official Discord server** for a better guild experience! 🚀  \n  \n🔗 **https://discord.gg/pPYKxpaTjN**  \n\n\n#### Discord Bot  \nOur Discord server contains several bots developed by us that offer different utilities:\n- **Souls Raid**: get notifications when **guild raids** start 🏰\n- **Souls World Boss**: get both server-wide and personal notifications when **world boss battles** are about to start with perfect timing, thanks to the public API (With bosses and notifications customization)  ⚔️  \n- **Souls Activity**: track guild activity (raids, challenges, and stockpile contributions) with rankings and rewards for most active members 🏆  \n- **Souls Weather**: check the weather for any location and get notified when a magic storm arrives 🌦️\n- **Souls Guild Hall**: get notified when buildings need repair and see what materials are available in the stockpile 🔨\n\n‎ \n \n\n\n### 🔹 Guild Hall\n- Location: **Isle of Whispers**\n- Structures: **Teleportation Beacon**, **Raid Planner**, **Unity Seal**, **Mission Table**, **Energizing Poll**, **Armoury**\n\n  ‎ \n  \n**Join us and bring your soul into our Hub!** 🌌",
